     methods.

Exclusion Criteria:

  -  Pregnant or breastfeeding women;

  -  History of obesity with a known cause (e.g., hypothyroidism, Cushing's disease);

  -  Under treatment with perindopril or other angiotensin converting enzyme (ACE)
